# Template for .env, which is gitignored and holds real credentials.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values, or use the helper command in
# README.md so the key is never echoed to your terminal history.
#
# ROBLOX_API_KEY  Open Cloud key from https://create.roblox.com/credentials
#                 Needs the universe-places:write scope and your current IP on
#                 the key's allowlist. Treat it like a password: it can
#                 overwrite the live place.
# ROBLOX_UNIVERSE_ID  The experience's universe ID (Creator Dashboard).
# ROBLOX_PLACE_ID     The place within that universe to overwrite.

ROBLOX_API_KEY=
ROBLOX_UNIVERSE_ID=
ROBLOX_PLACE_ID=
